All of my pictures were uploaded to my Facebook page on the day taken on Alum Creek Trail. Go to Kimberly N Castaneda to see video footage taken too. The female is visible, but the male is also on the log next to her.

This mallard was sitting on a log and a turtle swam up to get sun rays too!

